Was that my imagination?

89
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:39,100
Or was it really?

90
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,917
I don't have time to sit and ponder.

91
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:51,680
All that matters now is making
it upstairs and finding Dio.

92
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:53,500
Morning can wait.

93
